reevaluation HypercycleTraversalRechecked {
  satisfies memory HypercycleWitness
  outcome Confirmed
  summary "The backtracking traversal preserves deterministic hypercycle witness diagnostics."
  reviewer ShapeMaintainers
  decided_on "2026-05-20"
